messages[12]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hello... uh, hi Ravi? This is Kunal.
  user_2,Hey Kunal, good to hear from you. How can I help?
  user_1,I just wanted to double‑check that my health policy HP‑123456 is fully cancelled and that there's nothing left on my end.
  user_2,Yes, that's right. The policy was marked as expired on 30/09/2026, no pending premiums.
  user_1,Great—uh, so if I wanted to start a new plan next month, is there any waiting period?
  user_2,No waiting period, you can apply any time. Just let me know the coverage you need.
  user_1,Okay, I'll look at the options. Do I need any docs from the old policy?
  user_2,Just the cancellation confirmation we already emailed you. If you need it again, I can resend.
  user_1,Thanks, could you also send a quick summary of my claim history? I might need it for the new employer.
  user_2,Sure thing—I'll attach the claim summary to an email right after this call.
  user_1,Appreciate it, Ravi. Sorry for the long call, I've got a meeting in a few minutes.
  user_2,No problem, Kunal. Talk soon, and have a good meeting. [sighs]